  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification encodes the safe exploration policy: in clear states, random_walk is preferred for coverage, with short forward moves interleaved; obstacle events trigger conservative turn recovery, and full_rotate is reserved for rare, persistent blockage. All obstacle recoveries require a turn before returning to exploration. The design ensures safety, prevents oscillations, and maximizes forward progress when safe.",
